      "short": "$\\approx826.67\\text{ mg}$",
      "worked": "$\\begin{align*}15\\%&=124\\text{ mg}\\\\1\\%&=\\frac{124}{15}\\text{ mg}\\\\100\\%&=\\frac{124}{15}\\times100\\text{ mg}\\\\&=\\frac{2480}{3}\\text{ mg}\\\\&\\approx826.67\\text{ mg}\\end{align*}$\nThe recommended daily intake is approximately $826.67\\text{ mg}$, to 2 decimal places.",
